### 1. PRUEBAS DE CONTENEDORES
### ==========================================

### Crear Contenedor (Caso Válido)
POST {{Aurum.Api_HostAddress}}/api/files/container
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "containerName": "test"
}

###

### Crear Contenedor (Caso Inválido - Disparará el 400 Bad Request de FluentValidation)
POST {{Aurum.Api_HostAddress}}/api/files/container
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "containerName": "CONTENEDOR_MAYUSCULAS_INVALIDO!"
}

###

### Eliminar Contenedor (Caso Válido)
DELETE {{Aurum.Api_HostAddress}}/api/files/container/test

